            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jean Marie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "perfect i used grated romano/ parmesan added fresh basil from the garden less garlic &amp; a sprinkle or two of italian seasonings \nI fried it all in a cast iron skillet (from grandma) so it was golden brown &amp; excellent \nthis first time i cut thick slabs of zucchini next time i think i will cut them thin like chips ..they got darker &amp; crisper werent as \"soggy\" as the thickest slabs but BOTH ways this is a great recipie",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-22T22:53:33.360Z"
          },
          {
