              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hariet Brown"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I started whipping these spears up for our neighbor’s dog’s coronation as the queen of their family. Haha, it was something else! Anyway, I ran into one HUGE problem in my prep. It turned out we were completely out of Parmesan. I didn’t want to go with no cheese so I topped these off with a healthy portion of cottage cheese, one staple I’m never without! Let me tell you, it was a REVELATION. Cottage cheese can simply make any dish a belly buster. These were DELICIOUS!",
